OL,3,GNEWSATwo-year train platform closure
OL,4,A'unacceptable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe two-year closure of a station
OL,7,Fplatform which is forcing passengers to
OL,8,Fuse a rail-replacement bus is
OL,9,F"unacceptable", a councillor has said.
OL,11,FPassengers have been unable to access
OL,12,Fplatform two at South Bank train
OL,13,Fstation, near Middlesbrough, after
OL,14,Fsafety concerns were raised about the
OL,15,Ffootbridge leading to it.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
