OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F392A1791869208
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATwo-year train platform closure
OL,4,A'unacceptable'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrains that previously called at the
OL,7,Fstation, on the way to Redcar, now pass
OL,8,Fnon-stop and the service has been
OL,9,Freplaced by a bus. Labour councillor
OL,10,FCarl Quartermain said the 30-minute bus
OL,11,Fwas not a "satisfactory long-term
OL,12,Fsubstitute" for the far quicker train.
OL,14,FTees Valley Combined Authority (TVCA)
OL,15,Fand Network Rail said they were working
OL,16,Fto solve the problem.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
